# Unity generated/machine-specific folders.
# These are caches rebuilt from Assets/ + Packages/ + ProjectSettings/ on any machine.
# Committing (or Drive-syncing) them is what corrupted this project before - see docs/START_HERE.md.
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]in/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Rr]ecordings/

# Asset Store / package caches
[Aa]ssets/AssetStoreTools*
[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*

# Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
